    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a high-stakes journey through the twilight in <i>Echoes of the Night</i>, a rhythm-action game inspired by <i>Sayonara Wild Hearts</i>. Set to the electrifying sounds of Barney &amp; Company's debut album, this stylish adventure follows two master thieves on a collision course\u2014both chasing the same score, both chasing something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six dazzling levels, each pulsing to a track from <i>No Refusal</i>, you'll race, dodge, and fight through a heist gone beautifully wrong. Will they fall for each other or double-cross one another in a winner-takes-all showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 1 - Drove by a Pretty Place</strong><br>Race through a breathtaking, European-inspired countryside as you dodge traffic and obstacles on your way to the grand castle\u2014your heist begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 2 - Light It Up (Coming Soon)</strong><br>Mingle among the elite at a lavish masquerade ball, stealing valuables without being caught. But beware\u2014you're not the only phantom thief in the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 3 - Liar (Coming Soon)</strong><br>A dance-off like no other! Face off against your rival phantom thief in a rhythm-based showdown, hitting the right moves to outshine\u2014or be outshined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 4 - Barney (Coming Soon)</strong><br>The security is onto you! Navigate a sprawling castle maze, avoiding cameras and patrols as you make your daring escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 5 - For What It's Worth (Coming Soon)</strong><br>The grand finale\u2014a high-speed chase atop a moving train! Time your jumps, dodge obstacles, and battle enemies in a climactic confrontation with your rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a high-stakes journey through the twilight in <i>Echoes of the Night</i>, a rhythm-action game inspired by <i>Sayonara Wild Hearts</i>. Set to the electrifying sounds of Barney &amp; Company's debut album, this stylish adventure follows two master thieves on a collision course\u2014both chasing the same score, both chasing something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six dazzling levels, each pulsing to a track from <i>No Refusal</i>, you'll race, dodge, and fight through a heist gone beautifully wrong. Will they fall for each other or double-cross one another in a winner-takes-all showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 1 - Drove by a Pretty Place</strong><br>Race through a breathtaking, European-inspired countryside as you dodge traffic and obstacles on your way to the grand castle\u2014your heist begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 2 - Light It Up (Coming Soon)</strong><br>Mingle among the elite at a lavish masquerade ball, stealing valuables without being caught. But beware\u2014you're not the only phantom thief in the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 3 - Liar (Coming Soon)</strong><br>A dance-off like no other! Face off against your rival phantom thief in a rhythm-based showdown, hitting the right moves to outshine\u2014or be outshined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 4 - Barney (Coming Soon)</strong><br>The security is onto you! Navigate a sprawling castle maze, avoiding cameras and patrols as you make your daring escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Chapter 5 - For What It's Worth (Coming Soon)</strong><br>The grand finale\u2014a high-speed chase atop a moving train! Time your jumps, dodge obstacles, and battle enemies in a climactic confrontation with your rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
